{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the <i>Obakenori Demo\u00a0</i>you play as the titular character, a once powerful sea demon stuck in the form of an onigiri. In the demo discover a curated version of the games opening levels featuring a small number of the characters, ingredients and unlockable head wear that will be available in the full game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features for the DEMO</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat (tasty) foes and collect ingredients for the Chef!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth, satisfying platforming as you explore new locations and navigate interesting puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet (some of) the cast of characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Obakenori's form and discover new game play mechanics to reach new areas! (more in the full game!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hats for Obakenori to wear (many more to be added in the full game!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English only dialogue and menus in the demo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/extras/c700a125ab128837eb02ac66895407a1.poster.avif?t=1759480949\" width=1014 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/extras/c700a125ab128837eb02ac66895407a1.webm?t=1759480949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/extras/c700a125ab128837eb02ac66895407a1.mp4?t=1759480949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single player 3D collectathon platformer inspired by the days of early 3D gaming. Created by a solo developer, the world of Obakenori is teeming with playful (but not always friendly) creatures, hidden treasures, puzzles and of course, food related quests for the Chef!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/extras/86caea50b8745db124a54dbf8642410d.poster.avif?t=1759480949\" width=1014 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/extras/86caea50b8745db124a54dbf8642410d.webm?t=1759480949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/extras/86caea50b8745db124a54dbf8642410d.mp4?t=1759480949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features for the FULL GAME</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a range of abilities to help traverse the world and defeat (tasty) foes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth, satisfying platforming as you explore new locations and navigate interesting puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the cast of characters, some who want to guide you, and some who want your power for themselves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysteries of who Obakenori is, his 'family' and how he ended up as a rice ball!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a friendship with the Chef and Mechanic, although things might start off rocky!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079670?t=1759480949","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4079670?t=1759480949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/d7aa713bdbe5d4a7381c979031d8d9e2bad39afe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759480949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset