akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4079670/2f090f8f79d1d61c0d052d1bd2729c6f6402d8f5/ss_2f090f8f79d1d61c0d052d1bd2729c6f6402d8f5.600x338.jpg?t=1759480949"}],"short_description":"Become Obakenori, a once powerful sea demon stuck in the form of an onigiri, and help him regain his former power! A 3D platforming adventure where you explore vivid environments, interact with the strange inhabitants as you gather ingredients, unlock new abilities and uncover secrets of this world!","steam_appid":4079670,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://www.obakenori.com"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":"https://www.obakenori.com"}